# `uploads` is the older name of `artifacts`: no help lists it, but every
# command under it still runs, and its help is the help of `artifacts`.
@registry
@file a.txt hello
gruntas uploads create a.txt --quiet
gruntas uploads show art_000000000000000000000000
gruntas uploads
gruntas help uploads --format human
gruntas uplods list
gruntas help uploads bogus --format human
